an style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;：顯示&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 24px; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;各品類之&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;媒體清單&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 28px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt; PS: 現況是全媒體顯示, 沒做任何品類過濾&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
